E AX3024 405-macro-depth-limit.ax:3:370-371 macro-expansion-limit "macro expansion nested deeper than the limit of 1024 forms" !"the parser's own nesting limit measures the SOURCE, and this limit measures what expansion produced from it" ?"expansion is a rewrite, so the program the compiler sees is the expanded one; make the macro produce less, or write the repeated part as a function and let the macro expand to a call"
